<title>UK: EIB sets $1.0 billion 10-year Eurobond, +17-18 bp.</title>
<headline>EIB sets $1.0 billion 10-year Eurobond, +17-18 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CS First Boston and Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT	  $1.0 BLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    18.SEP.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    18.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+17-18 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  20	  PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.00 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 15.JUL.06</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
